{"id": "34338", "title": "姊姊嫁给我", "author": "宝贝", "category": "文学名著", "count": 38, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/34/34338.htm", "intro": "怎么办？！她迷路了耶！如果是平常也罢，她居然迷失在一片广无天际的大草原上，这下该糟啰！可忽然从天上掉下来一个“礼物”……呃──不是，是白马王子啦！让她的心头浮现自己得救的快乐念头，没想到他一开口不是嘲弄她，就是污辱她的美，还跟她斤斤计较如果他伸出援手，她该支付多少“赎金”，有没有搞错啊？他以为她就非当他的“人质新娘”不可吗？他没看到已经有粉多人出马要解救她了吗？果然，他立刻见风转舵，还随手拐骗她的贴身纪念品当作“勒索”，硬逼她将来要跟他约会，才肯物归原主，她本该不屑他这种强盗作风，却在听到他对她的告白后，她的心怎么就这么莫名的沦陷了呢……", "base": "files/article/html/34/34338", "chapters": [{"title": "第1页", "file": "2182111.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2页", "file": "2182112.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3页", "file": "2182113.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4页", "file": "2182114.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5页", "file": "2182115.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6页", "file": "2182116.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7页", "file": "2182117.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8页", "file": "2182118.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9页", "file": "2182119.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10页", "file": "2182120.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11页", "file": "2182121.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12页", "file": "2182122.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13页", "file": "2182123.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14页", "file": "2182124.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15页", "file": "2182125.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16页", "file": "2182126.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17页", "file": "2182127.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18页", "file": "2182128.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19页", "file": "2182129.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20页", "file": "2182130.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21页", "file": "2182131.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22页", "file": "2182132.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23页", "file": "2182133.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第24页", "file": "2182134.html", "availa